  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 9454587,
  "published": "2026-04-20T02:11:48.14Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release. Successor to the deprecated FieldCure.DocumentParsers.Pdf.Ocr. Provides `OcrPdfParser` (replaces the old `PdfParser(IOcrEngine)` overload), `TesseractOcrEngine` with English + Korean tessdata, and `DocumentParserFactoryOcrExtensions.AddOcrSupport()` / `AddOcrSupport(IOcrEngine)`. Namespace: `FieldCure.DocumentParsers.Ocr`. Depends on FieldCure.DocumentParsers.Imaging for page rendering. Windows only — assembly is marked `[SupportedOSPlatform(\"windows\")]`. Linux / macOS support is planned for a future release.",
